  Little Red Riding Hood: 9 entities, 3 locations, 24 slides
  1. [woodland] establish {red, basket}
      Little Red Riding Hood carries Red’s Basket along the winding dirt path.
  2. [woodland] entry {red, wolf, basket}
      The Wolf steps from the dense fern banks onto the winding dirt path.
  3. [woodland] act {red, wolf, basket} Δ Several stems in the low bed of white daisies now lack flowers.
      Little Red Riding Hood picks white daisies from the low bed of white daisies.
  4. [cottage-inside] establish {grandmother, nightcap, scissors, needle}
      Grandmother waits beside the open wooden entrance door.
  5. [cottage-inside] entry {wolf, grandmother, nightcap, scissors, needle}
      The Wolf enters through the open wooden entrance door.
  6. [cottage-inside] act {wolf, nightcap, scissors, needle}
      The Wolf swallows Grandmother whole beside the wooden entrance door. Grandmother’s Nightcap falls beside the wooden entrance door.
  7. [cottage-inside] act {wolf, nightcap, scissors, needle}
      The Wolf puts Grandmother’s Nightcap over his ears.
  8. [cottage-inside] move {wolf, nightcap, scissors, needle}
      The Wolf walks around the front end of the low sewing table.
  9. [cottage-inside] move {wolf, nightcap, scissors, needle} Δ The blue patchwork quilt now covers The Wolf from his chest to his feet.
      The Wolf climbs beneath the blue patchwork quilt from the right side of the large wooden bed.
  10. [cottage-inside] entry {red, wolf, basket, nightcap, scissors, needle}
      Little Red Riding Hood enters through the open wooden entrance door.
  11. [cottage-inside] act {red, wolf, basket, nightcap, scissors, needle} Δ Red’s Basket now rests on the floor beside the wooden entrance door.
      Little Red Riding Hood puts Red’s Basket on the floor beside the wooden entrance door.
  12. [cottage-inside] move {red, wolf, basket, nightcap, scissors, needle}
      Little Red Riding Hood walks around the front end of the low sewing table.
  13. [cottage-inside] move {red, wolf, basket, nightcap, scissors, needle}
      Little Red Riding Hood walks along the left side of the low sewing table to the large wooden bed.
  14. [cottage-inside] act {red, wolf, basket, nightcap, scissors, needle}
      Little Red Riding Hood grips her cape beside the large wooden bed.
  15. [cottage-inside] act {wolf, basket, nightcap, scissors, needle} Δ The blue patchwork quilt now lies below The Wolf's swollen belly.
      The Wolf swallows Little Red Riding Hood whole beside the large wooden bed.
  16. [cottage-inside] act {wolf, basket, nightcap, scissors, needle}
      The Wolf falls asleep in the large wooden bed.
  17. [cottage-inside] entry {huntsman, wolf, basket, nightcap, scissors, needle}
      The Huntsman enters through the open wooden entrance door.
  18. [cottage-inside] act {huntsman, wolf, basket, nightcap, scissors, needle}
      The Huntsman cuts an opening in The Wolf's belly with Sewing Scissors.
  19. [cottage-inside] act {red, huntsman, wolf, basket, nightcap, scissors, needle}
      Little Red Riding Hood climbs from The Wolf's belly onto the blue patchwork quilt.
  20. [cottage-inside] act {red, grandmother, huntsman, wolf, basket, nightcap, scissors, needle}
      Grandmother climbs from The Wolf's belly into Little Red Riding Hood's arms.
  21. [cottage-inside] act {red, grandmother, huntsman, wolf, basket, nightcap, scissors, needle, stones}
      Little Red Riding Hood and The Huntsman put Heavy Stones into The Wolf's belly.
  22. [cottage-inside] act {red, grandmother, huntsman, wolf, basket, nightcap, scissors, needle}
      Grandmother closes The Wolf's belly with Threaded Needle.
  23. [cottage-inside] act {red, grandmother, huntsman, wolf, basket, nightcap, scissors, needle}
      The Wolf starts awake in the large wooden bed.
  24. [cottage-inside] act {red, grandmother, huntsman, wolf, basket, nightcap, scissors, needle}
      The Wolf collapses dead under the weight of Heavy Stones.
